# Type errors do not fail `build:core` / `build:react` — vite-plugin-dts prints them and exits 0 — and
# the CI workflow is disabled, so nothing else catches them. Ten of them once sat on `main` unnoticed
# for that exact reason. This is the gate.
#
# Covers all three projects (core, react, react-demo) including their `*.spec.*` files. `apps/react-demo`
# is the only real consumer of the public API in this repo, so it doubles as the early warning that a
# type change breaks downstream.
#
# Nx caches the result, so a re-push with nothing changed costs about a second.
# Escape hatch, for a knowingly broken WIP branch: `git push --no-verify`.
npm run typecheck
